# Docker build context for deploy/Dockerfile (built from the project root).
#
# Two layers of protection:
#   1. Allow-list: everything is excluded, then only what the images need is re-included.
#   2. Explicit exclusions after it: secrets, databases, caches and reports are excluded
#      even if one ends up inside an allowed folder (in .dockerignore the last matching
#      rule wins).
#
# Required in the context (do not exclude): app/ (including app/database/, which holds
# the schema creation and upgrade code that runs at startup; there are no separate
# migration files), frontend/, scripts/ (maintenance scripts: FAQ import, retention
# cleanup, anonymization, staff tokens), data/faqs.json (FAQ seed),
# .streamlit/config.toml and deploy/requirements/ (hash-locked dependencies).
# Checked by tests/test_deployment_config.py.

# --- 1. Allow-list ------------------------------------------------------------------------
*
!deploy/requirements/
!app/
!frontend/
!scripts/
!data/faqs.json
!.streamlit/config.toml

# --- 2. Explicit exclusions (also inside the allowed folders) ----------------------------

# Environment files and local credentials
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/secrets/
**/secrets.toml
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.htpasswd
**/.netrc
**/.pypirc
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*

# Virtual environments
**/.venv/
**/venv/
**/.audit-venv/

# Version control
**/.git/
**/.gitignore
**/.gitattributes

# Local SQLite databases (customer data) and their journals
**/*.db
**/*.db-journal
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3

# Backups and archives
**/backups/
**/*.bak
**/*.backup
**/*.zip
**/*.tar
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.tgz
**/*.7z
**/*.gz

# Python caches and build output
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.egg-info/
**/build/
**/dist/

# Test reports, coverage and tool caches
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/coverage.xml
**/htmlcov/
**/junit*.xml
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.hypothesis/
**/.tox/
**/.nox/

# Logs and temporary files
**/*.log
**/logs/
**/*.tmp
**/*.temp
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~

# Editor and OS files
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/.history/
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/Desktop.ini
